      "writtenOn": "2021-06-28T21:30:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "All of this needs moved to another CL.\n\nThe initial CL needs to be basic UART function only, no GPIO, features etc.\n\nThe documented bringup procedure is here: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/HEAD/docs/zephyr_poc_device_bringup.md#initial-bringup\n\n\n(of course, this document is geared towards a PoC device... we will need to modify slightly)",
