        "id": 1000407
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-28T22:28:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The herobrine_npcx7 hardware is actually a Trogdor board (Trogdor rev2) but swaps the SoC-related part to a different SoC (partitioning the board). Trogdor vs Lazor is a reference design vs an OEM device. So they are very similar. We usually just carry everything over from a reference design to an OEM device, or from one OEM device to another OEM device.",
      "parentUuid": "9a7d3b59_83097580",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 148,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "b7a726cc636aafc033fc3b31e2b93bcc57dbfbeb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
