        "id": 1330845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-29T21:11:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we share a lot in common, we should just locate ourselves in the trogdor directory. The zephyr projects weren\u0027t designed for copy-paste coding like in platform/ec ... i.e., we have documented bringup procedures, and it isn\u0027t to copy/paste.",
      "parentUuid": "1603f477_f8f3a9ca",
      "range": {
